<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Smithfield cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Smithfield cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth analyst Bonnie Wittenburg said she downgraded Smithfield Foods Inc to hold from buy based primarily on price.</p>
<p>Shares in the company were off 1-1/4 to 59.</p>
</text>
